"lines": [
{
"s": 0.0,
"e": 3.513,
"text": "If you dig a hole on a beach to hide from a tsunami, you have a bathtub."
},
{
"s": 3.757,
"e": 7.443,
"text": "But the first wave pours in, fills it to the top and you barely scramble out."
},
{
"s": 7.861,
"e": 10.504,
"text": "You can't hide down from a tsunami, you have to go up."
},
{
"s": 10.922,
"e": 13.496,
"text": "So you shovel the sand into a tall hill and climb on top."
},
{
"s": 13.913,
"e": 16.835,
"text": "But the wave comes faster than you can run and washes the hill away."
},
{
"s": 17.252,
"e": 19.826,
"text": "So you pour concrete walls and build a solid tower."
},
{
"s": 20.035,
"e": 23.443,
"text": "But a solid wall catches the full push of the wave and it cracks wide open."
},
{
"s": 23.861,
"e": 26.643,
"text": "So you leave the ground floor open and the water flows right through."
},
{
"s": 27.13,
"e": 28.522,
"text": "This is a tsunami tower."
},
{
"s": 28.87,
"e": 31.513,
"text": "But the rushing water digs the sand out from under your columns."
},
{
"s": 31.861,
"e": 35.13,
"text": "So you drive long piles deep through the sand into the hard clay below."
},
{
"s": 35.548,
"e": 38.539,
"text": "And the wave brings boats and cars that smash into everything."
},
{
"s": 38.887,
"e": 42.191,
"text": "So the columns get thick and round and the junk slides right past."
},
{
"s": 42.365,
"e": 45.496,
"text": "But you only get minutes of warning and your whole family has to climb."
},
{
"s": 45.913,
"e": 49.287,
"text": "So you wrap a wide ramp around the tower and everyone runs up fast."
},
{
"s": 49.461,
"e": 51.896,
"text": "But some waves get taller than a three-story house."
},
{
"s": 52.243,
"e": 55.374,
"text": "So the roof goes 30% higher than the biggest wave they predict."
},
{
"s": 55.583,
"e": 59.687,
"text": "And if the sea ever pulls back and the beach goes empty, don't look, run up."
},
{
"s": 60.035,
"e": 62.817,
"text": "The ground floor isn't unfinished, it's empty on purpose."
},
{
"s": 63.026,
"e": 64.557,
"text": "So the wave goes right through."
},
{
"s": 64.765,
"e": 67.548,
"text": "Add a blanket, a radio, and a crab who climbed up with you."
},
{
"s": 67.896,
"e": 70.748,
"text": "Congratulations, you have built a tsunami tower."
}
]
